STATUS

Background brief for the Urkaaaz Android launch screen. The current image is
the supplied Green Frontier fortress scene, installed at
`assets_src/splash/splash_background.png` and
`android-app/src/main/res/drawable-nodpi/splash_background.png` as a 1920 × 1080
PNG. The game logo and AFACODE company logo remain separate runtime overlays.

REFERENCE INPUTS

- Attach `assets_src/splash/urkaaz_game_logo.png` as the primary style and
  palette reference. Match its colorful, chunky, polished fantasy-game
  illustration and playful siege mood. Do not copy its composition, redraw
  its characters, or include any part of the logo in the background.
- Attach `assets_src/dashboard/dashboard_background_approved.png` as a
  secondary reference for the game's painterly finish, warm lighting, and
  material quality. Do not copy its composition or characters.
- The exact company logo is stored at
  `assets_src/splash/afacode_company_logo.png`. The app renders it as a
  separate, unmodified transparent overlay at the lower-right over a soft warm
  glow. Keep that corner quiet and low-detail. Do not draw, regenerate, crop,
  recolor, distort, or bake the company logo into the background.
- The game logo is rendered as a separate, unmodified transparent overlay
  centered slightly above the screen midpoint. Keep the central area visually
  calm and contrasting enough for its green and gold lettering, goblin, and
  catapults to read clearly.

PROMPT

Create one full-bleed landscape background for the opening splash screen of
Urkaaaz! Catapult Chaos, a playful fantasy siege game. Match the supplied game
logo's polished, colorful, chunky illustrated style: hand-painted 3D-game
materials, expressive shapes, warm timber and stone, rich forest greens,
golden light, and restrained red and blue team accents. The result should feel
like the same game world as the logo, not a dark runic fantasy wallpaper.

Show a broad, cinematic view of a whimsical frontier battlefield at a calm
moment: rolling green hills, distant timber-and-stone fortress walls, layered
evergreen forest, and a few small red and blue banners near the far edges.
Use framing environment details along the outer sides and lower edge to give
the screen depth and a clear catapult-siege setting. Keep any siege
silhouettes tiny and distant; do not add a foreground character, orc, or
prominent catapult that competes with or duplicates the supplied logo.

Use a cohesive palette of forest and moss greens, warm amber sunlight,
weathered brown timber, grey-brown stone, and muted slate-teal shadows. Add
soft atmospheric depth and painterly light, with a lively, welcoming
adventure-game mood. Keep the central logo-safe area (roughly the middle 70%
of the canvas, slightly above center) open and low-detail, using a muted
slate-teal or deep blue-green sky/haze behind the logo so both its green and
gold lettering remain distinct. The center must not be black, empty-gradient
minimalism, or covered in foliage, structures, particles, or runes.

Keep the lower-right corner especially quiet and moderately dark so the exact
transparent AFACODE logo can be composited there by the app over its separate
soft warm glow. Do not put a bright sun, banner, fortress edge, or strong
highlight behind that overlay. Respect safe margins around all edges because
Android may crop a small amount of the 16:9 image on extra-wide landscape
screens.

This is a static background layer, not a finished screenshot. Do not include
the game logo, company logo, any text or lettering, numbers, interface,
buttons, loading indicators, device frames, watermarks, or signatures. Do not
recreate the exact characters, catapults, banners, or composition from the
logo reference. The environment should support the supplied foreground logo,
not become a second focal illustration.

OUTPUT

- Output exactly one file: `splash_background.png`.
- Canvas: exactly 1920 × 1080 pixels, landscape 16:9.
- Use an opaque RGB or RGBA PNG suitable for full-screen Android rendering.
- Fill the entire canvas edge-to-edge; do not add borders, letterboxing, a
  device frame, mockup, contact sheet, or alternate versions.
- Save the generated source to `assets_src/splash/splash_background.png`.
  The Android runtime copy is
  `android-app/src/main/res/drawable-nodpi/splash_background.png`.

NEGATIVE PROMPT

text, letters, numbers, title, game logo, URKAAAZ, AFACODE, watermark,
signature, UI, buttons, loading bar, progress indicator, phone, device frame,
mockup, contact sheet, multiple variants, foreground character, orc, goblin,
prominent catapult, duplicated logo artwork, close-up siege engine, projectile,
explosion, active battle, damage, blood, central focal subject, crowded center,
busy foliage behind the logo, bright green or gold clutter behind the logo,
oversized rune, arcane emblem, dense runes, pseudo-writing, glowing text,
bright or detailed lower-right corner, direct highlight behind AFACODE,
near-black minimalist wallpaper, generic empty gradient, photorealism, harsh
neon colors, excessive bloom, lens flare, unrelated franchise, copied
commercial art

ACCEPTANCE CHECK

1. The output is one full-bleed 1920 × 1080 PNG background, not a screen mockup.
2. Its playful, colorful fantasy-siege art direction clearly complements the
   supplied game logo and replaces the previous dark runic mood.
3. There is no text or logo embedded in the background; the supplied game and
   AFACODE logos remain exact, separate runtime overlays.
4. The middle area stays calm and contrasting enough for the game logo, while
   the lower-right remains quiet for the AFACODE overlay and its warm glow.
5. The environment gives a recognizable frontier/fortress setting without
   adding a competing character, foreground catapult, or busy battle scene.
